    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Photos of mid-intertidal communities at Soberanes Point. These are permanent plots that began in 2001 and have been maintained throughout with some gaps.  Originally 64 - 1 sq meter plots were marked and monitored, starting in 2008 only 32 could be accessed due to a slide.  For description and coordinates of sites see Micheli et al. (2016) Combined impacts of natural and human disturbances on rocky shore communities. Ocean and Coastal Management 162: 42-50",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
